WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.322 --> 00:00:02.604
Every missed inquiry is a chance that

2
00:00:02.654 --> 00:00:04.239
may never return.

3
00:00:05.346 --> 00:00:06.931
I start by connecting calls,

4
00:00:06.981 --> 00:00:10.694
forms, and landing pages to one CRM.

5
00:00:11.346 --> 00:00:13.844
Then I check duplicates and consent,

6
00:00:13.894 --> 00:00:16.994
assign an owner, and trigger the right follow-up.

7
00:00:21.346 --> 00:00:23.400
When a lead replies or books,

8
00:00:23.450 --> 00:00:24.923
the sequence stops.

9
00:00:24.973 --> 00:00:26.567
The goal is simple:

10
00:00:26.617 --> 00:00:29.900
faster responses and fewer overlooked opportunities.

